<title>UK: Egypt bought 20,000 T palm oil at tender - traders.</title>
<headline>Egypt bought 20,000 T palm oil at tender - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt bought a total of 20,000 tonnes of palm oil at its tender held on Wednesday, European vegetable oil traders said.</p>
<p>It bought 10,000 tonnes of RBD palm oil at $534.20 a tonne c and f and 10,000 tonnes of palm stearin at $404 a tonne c and f for July arrival, they said.</p>
<p>Traders said FELDA was the seller.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
